          stopped instance, its volumes, its Elastic IP and the snapshots of those volumes, with one total saving.
          spendlens reads how resources connect, read-only, prices every one from your price book, and finds
          <b>cleanup groups</b>: resources that can be removed together, each counted once.</p>
        <ul class="chips"><li>7 cleanup rules</li><li>Waste alarms linked, not added</li><li><a href="{{ root }}docs/graph/">How it works ›</a></li></ul>
      </div>
    </div>
